  "interpretation_boundary": "Measurements compare independent, host-PDC-compensated Ableton exports of one installed FabFilter Pro-MB VST3 instance over a deterministic 72-second composite arrangement. They establish the no-band default audio boundary, one downward compression band, the installed build's global Lookahead latency behavior, and content-local differences between global Lookahead On and Off at 48 kHz. The shared bypass was rendered from the same arrangement and chain before Pro-MB loading; triangular dither prevents a bit-perfect null and therefore small residual noise is expected. The experiment does not establish exact crossover transfer, separate sine-sweep behavior, external-sidechain routing, Expand/upward modes, Minimum/Linear Phase, oversampling, stereo-link or M/S behavior, automation, CPU cost, other formats/sample rates, or musical preference on real vocals."
}
